                                                "sense_id": "dc101352-c9e9-30f7-91b5-c17be119cd6c",
                                                "text": "The repeated exposure, over decades, to most taxa here treated has resulted in repeated modifications of both diagnoses and discussions, as initial ideas of the various taxa underwent—often repeated—conceptual modification."
                                            }
